IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part2-prisoners`
IMPORT `spr-part3-deferral`

-- Tests for regulations 4 to 12A (spr-part3-deferral.l4).
-- Expected values are decided from the text of the regulation named beside each
-- group, before running. Dates are counted by conventions F1 and F2 where the text
-- says "N days/months starting on" (NOTES.md).

§ `Fixtures for regulation 4`
`notice 15 Jan 2027, choice on 15 Jan 2027` MEANS ChoicePeriodFacts WITH
    `the person falls within section 8(1) of the 2014 Act` IS TRUE
    `the date in the most recent notice, issued before the choice was made, confirming that the person may make the choice, if any` IS JUST (YMD 2027 1 15)
    `the date the person claims a state pension` IS YMD 2027 3 1
    `the date the person's spouse or civil partner died` IS YMD 2027 2 10
    `the date the person makes the choice` IS YMD 2027 1 15
`notice 15 Jan 2027, choice on 14 Apr 2027` MEANS ChoicePeriodFacts WITH
    `the person falls within section 8(1) of the 2014 Act` IS TRUE
